      "excerpt": "Now change only `Color(a, b, c)` to `Color(c, b, a)`. Predict which channel survives unchanged. Run it: red and blue exchange jobs, green stays, and the generator makes exactly the same requests. Restore the original assignment. Explain why matching seeds were insufficient to preserve the picture after that edit.",
